      "text": "Individual Logins:\n\n- card\nAs a COMMON USER, I want to be able\nto login so that I can enter the main\npage and see my expenses\n\n- conversation\n    \n    user data:\n    {\n        email,\n        password,\n        name,    \n    }\n    \n- confirmation\nthe email must match the password\nassociated with it to let the user login\n\nthe password stored on the database\nmust be encrypted",
